#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Saved kernel stack exists.  (This is a kernel sanity check; the saved stack "
"should exist only within vm86 mode itself.)"
msgstr ""
"Existe la pila del núcleo salvaguardada. (Ésta es una comprobación "
"prudencial del núcleo; la pila salvaguardada sólo existe dentro del propio "
"modo vm86.)"

